#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>えっと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Umm...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr "Ờm..."

#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. …あれ？
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Hả?"

#. <CLT 4>ない…な…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's gone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr "Biến mất rồi..."

#. <CLT 4>戦刃むくろの死体が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Mukuro's body...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. どこにも…ない…？
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's...not here?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この場所で調べられそうなところは、
#. これくらいか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's all I really needed to check here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それにしても…
#. 戦刃むくろの死体はどこに消えたんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...where could her body have gone?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>他の場所も回って、
#. 探してみた方がいいかもしれない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better start looking for it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そもそも、なんでモニターなんだ？
#. アナウンスだけでも良かったじゃないか。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Why do they even need all these monitors? A normal PA\n"
"announcement would work just as well...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Tại sao chúng lại cần tất cả những chiếc màn hình này chứ? Một\n"
"thông báo qua loa bình thường cũng hiệu quả rồi mà...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>…絵的に寂しいって事か？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe it's just to give us something to look at.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここ、毎日スプリンクラーで水を蒔くんだよな？
#. このカメラ…壊れたりしないのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This area gets soaked by the sprinklers every day,\n"
"right? And it doesn't break the camera?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もしかして、この物置の中に死体が…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe the body is inside the tool shed...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 一応、中を見てみるか…
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'd better check, just to be sure."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ニワトリは…４羽に減ったままだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are still just the four chickens left...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>元通りに増えてたら…
#. 逆に怖いけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Honestly, I'd be kinda terrified if there were more\n"
"than that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. モノクマフラワーか…
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The Monokuma Flower..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ゴミでもプラスチックでも人間でも食べるって…
#. 本当なのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is it true...? Does it really eat paper, plastic, and\n"
"people?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có thật không...? Nó thực sự ăn được cả giấy, nhựa, và con\n"
"người luôn sao?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>とにかく…事件には関係なさそうだし、
#. この花には近付かない方がいいな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, I don't think it's related to the case, so I'd\n"
"better keep my distance...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>スプリンクラーの制御パネルだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The sprinkler control panel...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>毎朝７時３０分にスプリンクラーが作動する設定で、
#. 変更も不可能だったはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They're set to turn on at 7:30 every morning. And\n"
"Monokuma said the time positively couldn't be changed.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>天井の…あの突起物…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Those nozzles poking out...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Những cái vòi nhô ra kia...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. あれは…スプリンクラーだ…
#. あそこから水がまかれるんだったな。
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Are those...the sprinklers? So that's where the water\n"
"comes out..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この破片…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This fragment...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマを解体した時に取り出した
#. あの爆弾の破片だった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's part of a bomb just like the one they found in\n"
"Monokuma when they took him apart.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり、死体の爆破に使われたのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So that must be what was used to blow up the body...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマから取り出した後、
#. 体育館に置かれていた爆弾ということだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We'd left it there in the gym. They must have come and\n"
"gotten it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このナイフが…
#. 犯人の偽装工作に使われたんだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The killer used this knife as a sort of camouflage...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まだ調べるべき事があるはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm sure there's more around here I need to check...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0031 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0032 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
